00:21:57.470 --> 00:21:58.770
I mean, I guess so.

526
00:21:58.990 --> 00:22:00.070
Well, I think.

527
00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:04.810
One of the glycols can also be used as some sort of a fiber.

528
00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:10.350
I don't think we have time to, in the moment, deep dive glycol, but we were curious.

529
00:22:11.310 --> 00:22:17.150
So I'm assuming that since SAG and NBCUniversal said it was safe, then we used the safe one.

530
00:22:17.290 --> 00:22:18.390
We used the safe one.

531
00:22:18.630 --> 00:22:19.510
Look at us.

532
00:22:19.590 --> 00:22:20.110
We're fine.

533
00:22:21.050 --> 00:22:21.990
We're here.

