00:24:24.190 --> 00:24:26.410
They used that same breakaway glass.

581
00:24:26.490 --> 00:24:32.590
He said it broke every time, but they had to do it a few extra times just to get a certain

582
00:24:32.590 --> 00:24:33.770
camera movement right.

583
00:24:34.070 --> 00:24:36.290
You know, they were doing the whip cuts.

584
00:24:36.490 --> 00:24:36.670
Right.

585
00:24:36.850 --> 00:24:37.930
To make it look frantic.

586
00:24:38.190 --> 00:24:38.370
Right.

587
00:24:38.850 --> 00:24:45.430
Now, next up, lady, I thought we should discuss this moment that no one wrote in about,

588
00:24:45.430 --> 00:24:46.830
but that was so epic.

