01:09:02.960 --> 01:09:05.840
How could you not react to Chloris coming out of the tub?

1507
01:09:06.020 --> 01:09:07.840
You had to be distracted on your phone.

1508
01:09:08.000 --> 01:09:09.320
I was like, holy crap.

1509
01:09:10.000 --> 01:09:12.720
So they had shot this a long time ago.

1510
01:09:12.720 --> 01:09:20.940
If you look at the call sheets for this episode, this bit of us in the conference room was not even on the schedule for these nine days.

1511
01:09:20.940 --> 01:09:30.220
Guys, we shot this another week later so that they could put together this mini movie so that we could have some reactions.

1512
01:09:30.720 --> 01:09:34.960
The first time they played them for us, we couldn't speak.

1513
01:09:35.020 --> 01:09:36.220
We were riveted.

1514
01:09:36.420 --> 01:09:38.020
We were like, what are we watching?

1515
01:09:38.060 --> 01:09:39.240
That was what I thought.

1516
01:09:39.360 --> 01:09:44.160
I was like, how can Jim and Pam, like, not just be falling out of their chairs right now?

1517
01:09:44.280 --> 01:09:47.220
And Andy's like, guys, they're making out.

1518
01:09:47.220 --> 01:09:59.180
Like, so what they did was they showed it to us and then we watched a blank screen, but we knew what we were supposed to be reacting to.

1519
01:09:59.240 --> 01:10:00.320
You knew the beats of it.

1520
01:10:00.380 --> 01:10:00.740
Yes.

1521
01:10:00.900 --> 01:10:01.060
Yeah.

1522
01:10:01.180 --> 01:10:04.320
And then they inserted it into the screen.

1523
01:10:04.520 --> 01:10:06.700
You know, if you notice, it's all over the shoulder.

1524
01:10:06.840 --> 01:10:07.480
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

1525
01:10:07.520 --> 01:10:07.880
Onto the thing.

1526
01:10:07.900 --> 01:10:09.360
I was very curious about that.

1527
01:10:09.520 --> 01:10:10.840
Yeah, it was bonkers.

1528
