1529
01:10:16.400 --> 01:10:18.480
God, you're so good at talking to people.

1530
01:10:18.480 --> 01:10:19.760
Yeah, maybe he'll open up to you.

1531
01:10:19.880 --> 01:10:20.160
Yeah.

1532
01:10:20.580 --> 01:10:23.100
This is not going to go the way Pam planned.

1533
01:10:23.280 --> 01:10:23.620
Yeah.

1534
01:10:23.980 --> 01:10:25.340
But that's for next week.

1535
01:10:25.680 --> 01:10:30.960
